                "dc.identifier.section_footnote" : [ {
                  "value" : "<sup>1</sup>. Subs. by Act 33 of 2020, s. 2, for clause (c) (w.e.f. 29-9-2020).<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <sup>2</sup>. <i>Explanation</i> subs. by Act 33 of 2020, s. 2 (w.e.f. 29-9-2020)<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
