                "dc.identifier.section_number" : [ {
                  "value" : "14A",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><b><sup>1</sup>[14A. Surrender of certificate.--</b>On a request being made in this behalf, the Central Government may permit any person to surrender the certificate granted under this Act, if, after making such inquiry as it deems fit, it is satisfied that such person has not contravened any of the provisions of this Act, and the management of foreign contribution and asset, if any, created out of such contribution has been vested in the authority as provided in sub-section (1) of section 15.]<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
