                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>No court shall take cognizance of any offence under this Act, except with the previous sanction of the Central Government or any officer authorised by that Government in this behalf.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
